00:38:00.510 --> 00:38:03.570
I focused on Latinx
businesses in the 20th century

00:38:03.570 --> 00:38:06.840
as social, cultural and political anchors.

00:38:06.840 --> 00:38:08.850
This summer with the help of RITM,

00:38:08.850 --> 00:38:12.300
I explored the Roybal Edward Papers

00:38:12.300 --> 00:38:16.080
and the Bradley Mayor
